  "content": {
    "id": "p22-q6-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "Simplify each of the following:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{9x+9}{2x+4}\\times\\frac{4x+8}{3x+3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$6$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{9x+9}{2x+4}\\times\\frac{4x+8}{3x+3}&=\\frac{9(x+1)}{2(x+2)}\\times\\frac{4(x+2)}{3(x+1)}\\\\\\frac{9x+9}{2x+4}\\times\\frac{4x+8}{3x+3}&=6\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{2x+2}{x+2}\\div\\frac{3x+3}{6x+6}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{4(x+1)}{x+2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2x+2}{x+2}\\div\\frac{3x+3}{6x+6}&=\\frac{2x+2}{x+2}\\times\\frac{6x+6}{3x+3}\\\\\\frac{2x+2}{x+2}\\div\\frac{3x+3}{6x+6}&=\\frac{2(x+1)}{x+2}\\times\\frac{6(x+1)}{3(x+1)}\\\\\\frac{2x+2}{x+2}\\div\\frac{3x+3}{6x+6}&=\\frac{4(x+1)}{x+2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{6x+6}{x-4}\\times\\frac{2x-8}{x^2+4x+4}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{12(x+1)}{(x+2)^2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{6x+6}{x-4}\\times\\frac{2x-8}{x^2+4x+4}&=\\frac{6(x+1)}{x-4}\\times\\frac{2(x-4)}{(x+2)^2}\\\\\\frac{6x+6}{x-4}\\times\\frac{2x-8}{x^2+4x+4}&=\\frac{12(x+1)}{(x+2)^2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{3x+1}{2x-4}\\times\\frac{x^2-4}{9x+3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{x+2}{6}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3x+1}{2x-4}\\times\\frac{x^2-4}{9x+3}&=\\frac{3x+1}{2(x-2)}\\times\\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{3(3x+1)}\\\\\\frac{3x+1}{2x-4}\\times\\frac{x^2-4}{9x+3}&=\\frac{x+2}{6}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{2x+10}{3x-3}\\times\\frac{x^2-1}{x+5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{2(x+1)}{3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2x+10}{3x-3}\\times\\frac{x^2-1}{x+5}&=\\frac{2(x+5)}{3(x-1)}\\times\\frac{(x-1)(x+1)}{x+5}\\\\\\frac{2x+10}{3x-3}\\times\\frac{x^2-1}{x+5}&=\\frac{2(x+1)}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{x^2+3x+2}{x^2+6x+5}\\div\\frac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2+8x+15}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1$\n\nMultiply by the reciprocal; all factors cancel.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2+3x+2}{x^2+6x+5}\\div\\frac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2+8x+15}&=\\frac{x^2+3x+2}{x^2+6x+5}\\times\\frac{x^2+8x+15}{x^2+5x+6}\\\\\\frac{x^2+3x+2}{x^2+6x+5}\\div\\frac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2+8x+15}&=\\frac{(x+1)(x+2)}{(x+1)(x+5)}\\times\\frac{(x+3)(x+5)}{(x+2)(x+3)}\\\\\\frac{x^2+3x+2}{x^2+6x+5}\\div\\frac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2+8x+15}&=1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2+x-6}\\times\\frac{x^2-2x-15}{x+3x-10}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{(x-5)(x+2)}{2(2x-5)}$\n\nCombine $x+3x-10=2(2x-5)$, then cancel the quadratic factors.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2+x-6}\\times\\frac{x^2-2x-15}{x+3x-10}&=\\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{(x+3)(x-2)}\\times\\frac{(x-5)(x+3)}{4x-10}\\\\\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2+x-6}\\times\\frac{x^2-2x-15}{x+3x-10}&=\\frac{(x-5)(x+2)}{2(2x-5)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{x^2+10x-11}{x^2-2x+1}\\div\\frac{x^2+9x-22}{2x^2-2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{2(x+1)}{x-2}$\n\nMultiply by the reciprocal and cancel the common factors.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2+10x-11}{x^2-2x+1}\\div\\frac{x^2+9x-22}{2x^2-2}&=\\frac{x^2+10x-11}{x^2-2x+1}\\times\\frac{2x^2-2}{x^2+9x-22}\\\\\\frac{x^2+10x-11}{x^2-2x+1}\\div\\frac{x^2+9x-22}{2x^2-2}&=\\frac{(x+11)(x-1)}{(x-1)^2}\\times\\frac{2(x-1)(x+1)}{(x+11)(x-2)}\\\\\\frac{x^2+10x-11}{x^2-2x+1}\\div\\frac{x^2+9x-22}{2x^2-2}&=\\frac{2(x+1)}{x-2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{2x+6}{x^2-6x+9}\\times\\frac{x^2-x-12}{x^2-16}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{2(x+3)^2}{(x-3)^2(x+4)}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2x+6}{x^2-6x+9}\\times\\frac{x^2-x-12}{x^2-16}&=\\frac{2(x+3)}{(x-3)^2}\\times\\frac{(x-4)(x+3)}{(x-4)(x+4)}\\\\\\frac{2x+6}{x^2-6x+9}\\times\\frac{x^2-x-12}{x^2-16}&=\\frac{2(x+3)^2}{(x-3)^2(x+4)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-j",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "j",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2+4x+4}\\div\\frac{x^2-4x+4}{7x^2+13x-2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{7x-1}{x-2}$\n\nMultiply by the reciprocal; factorise $7x^2+13x-2=(7x-1)(x+2)$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2+4x+4}\\div\\frac{x^2-4x+4}{7x^2+13x-2}&=\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2+4x+4}\\times\\frac{7x^2+13x-2}{x^2-4x+4}\\\\\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2+4x+4}\\div\\frac{x^2-4x+4}{7x^2+13x-2}&=\\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{(x+2)^2}\\times\\frac{(7x-1)(x+2)}{(x-2)^2}\\\\\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2+4x+4}\\div\\frac{x^2-4x+4}{7x^2+13x-2}&=\\frac{7x-1}{x-2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-k",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "k",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{6x^2-x-2}{6x-4}\\times\\frac{2}{4x^2-1}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{2x-1}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{6x^2-x-2}{6x-4}\\times\\frac{2}{4x^2-1}&=\\frac{(3x-2)(2x+1)}{2(3x-2)}\\times\\frac{2}{(2x-1)(2x+1)}\\\\\\frac{6x^2-x-2}{6x-4}\\times\\frac{2}{4x^2-1}&=\\frac{1}{2x-1}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-l",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "l",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{4x^2-12x+9}{10x^2-19x+6}\\div\\frac{4x^2-9}{10x-4}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{2}{2x+3}$\n\nMultiply by the reciprocal and cancel $5x-2$ and both factors of $2x-3$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{4x^2-12x+9}{10x^2-19x+6}\\div\\frac{4x^2-9}{10x-4}&=\\frac{4x^2-12x+9}{10x^2-19x+6}\\times\\frac{10x-4}{4x^2-9}\\\\\\frac{4x^2-12x+9}{10x^2-19x+6}\\div\\frac{4x^2-9}{10x-4}&=\\frac{(2x-3)^2}{(5x-2)(2x-3)}\\times\\frac{2(5x-2)}{(2x-3)(2x+3)}\\\\\\frac{4x^2-12x+9}{10x^2-19x+6}\\div\\frac{4x^2-9}{10x-4}&=\\frac{2}{2x+3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      }
    ]
  },
